---
// Komponen Visual Struktur Pembelajaran Preschool HBL (2 Hari Live Meeting + 3 Hari Mandiri di Rumah)
---

<div class="hbl-learning-structure max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-10" data-reveal>
  
  {/* Header Summary Banner */}
  <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-tsls-cream-50 border-l-4 border-tsls-wood-600 border-y border-r border-tsls-olive-950/15 shadow-sm">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-tsls-wood-600 block mb-1">
          RITME SEPEKAN (5 HARI BELAJAR)
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-tsls-olive-950">
          Struktur Pembelajaran Preschool HBL
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-bold">
        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-tsls-olive-950 text-tsls-cream-50">
          2 Hari Live Meeting (Talaqqi & Diniyah)
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-tsls-sand-400/30 text-tsls-wood-700 border border-tsls-wood-600/30">
          3 Hari Tematik Mandiri di Rumah
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Main 3 Pillars Grid */}
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
    
    {/* Pilar 1: 1 Hari Talaqqi Al-Qur'an */}
    <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-tsls-cream-50 border-t-4 border-tsls-olive-950 border-x border-b border-tsls-olive-950/15 shadow-sm space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between" style="--structure-idx: 0">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-tsls-olive-950/10 pb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-tsls-olive-950 text-tsls-cream-50">
            SESI 01 · LIVE MEETING
          </span>
          <span class="arabic-watermark text-xs text-tsls-olive-900/60 font-semibold">تَلَقِّي القُرْآن</span>
        </div>

        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-tsls-olive-950">
          1 Hari Talaqqi Al-Qur'an
        </h4>

        <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100 border border-tsls-olive-950/10 text-xs text-tsls-olive-950/85 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Tujuan:</strong> Mengembangkan kecintaan anak pada Al-Qur'an, memperbaiki bacaan, dan menanamkan hafalan sejak dini secara mutqin dan gembira.
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tsls-wood-600 block">
            Aktivitas Utama:
          </span>
          
          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-tsls-olive-950/80">
            <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950 block mb-0.5">Tajwid dan Tahsin</strong>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Anak dibimbing membaca Al-Qur'an dengan makhraj dan kaidah tajwid yang benar melalui metode talaqqi langsung.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950 block mb-0.5">Setoran Hafalan</strong>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Hafalan surah-surah pendek Juz 'Amma secara berjenjang dan menyenangkan tanpa paksaan psikologis.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-tsls-olive-950/10 text-[11px] font-semibold text-tsls-olive-800">
        Pendampingan talaqqi 1-on-1 & kelompok kecil
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 2: 1 Hari Tematik Diniyah */}
    <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-tsls-cream-50 border-t-4 border-tsls-wood-600 border-x border-b border-tsls-olive-950/15 shadow-sm space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between" style="--structure-idx: 1">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-tsls-olive-950/10 pb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-tsls-wood-600 text-tsls-cream-50">
            SESI 02 · LIVE MEETING
          </span>
          <span class="arabic-watermark text-xs text-tsls-wood-700/60 font-semibold">الدِّرَاسَاتُ الدِّينِيَّة</span>
        </div>

        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-tsls-olive-950">
          1 Hari Tematik Diniyah
        </h4>

        <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100 border border-tsls-olive-950/10 text-xs text-tsls-olive-950/85 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Tujuan:</strong> Membentuk akhlak mulia dan wawasan diniyah yang kokoh sesuai nilai-nilai Islam di atas manhaj Salafus Shalih.
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tsls-wood-600 block">
            6 Tema Pembelajaran:
          </span>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 text-xs text-tsls-olive-950/80">
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950">1. Aqidah & Manhaj:</strong> Konsep tauhid & mengenal Allah dengan bahasa sederhana.
            </div>
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950">2. Adab & Akhlak:</strong> Pembiasaan adab Islami dalam pergaulan sehari-hari.
            </div>
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950">3. Ibadah Harian:</strong> Praktik wudhu yang benar, shalat, dan dzikir harian.
            </div>
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950">4. Hadits Pilihan:</strong> Menghafal dan memahami intisari hadits-hadits pendek.
            </div>
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950">5. Tarbiyah Jinsiah:</strong> Pendidikan fitrah gender sejak usia dini.
            </div>
            <div class="p-2.5 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950">6. Keteladanan Muslim:</strong> Kisah Nabi, Rasul, Sahabat, Shohabiyat, Tabi’in, Ta’biyat, ibunda para ulama, ulama Ahlus Sunnah & ilmuwan muslim.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-tsls-olive-950/10 text-[11px] font-semibold text-tsls-wood-700">
        Menanamkan cinta teladan salaf & adab mulia
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 3: 3 Hari Tematik Mandiri di Rumah */}
    <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-tsls-cream-50 border-t-4 border-tsls-sage-500 border-x border-b border-tsls-olive-950/15 shadow-sm space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between" style="--structure-idx: 2">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-tsls-olive-950/10 pb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 bg-tsls-sage-500/30 text-tsls-olive-950 border border-tsls-sage-500/50">
            3 HARI · MANDIRI DI RUMAH
          </span>
          <span class="arabic-watermark text-xs text-tsls-olive-900/60 font-semibold">التَّعَلُّمُ المَنْزِلِيّ</span>
        </div>

        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-tsls-olive-950">
          3 Hari Tematik Mandiri (HBL)
        </h4>

        <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100 border border-tsls-olive-950/10 text-xs text-tsls-olive-950/85 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Tujuan:</strong> Mengembangkan keterampilan kognitif, motorik, sosial-emosional, dan seni melalui pendekatan tematik Preschool berbasis pengalaman nyata di rumah.
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tsls-wood-600 block">
            Fokus Stimulasi Nyata di Rumah:
          </span>

          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-tsls-olive-950/80">
            <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950 block mb-0.5">Kognitif & Pra-Sains Alam</strong>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Eksplorasi benda konkret di rumah, pola bentuk, klasifikasi warna, dan percobaan sains sederhana.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950 block mb-0.5">Motorik Halus & Seni Fitrah</strong>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Melatih kelenturan jari lewat meremas playdough alami, menggunting, meronce, mewarnai, dan membuat kerajinan.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 bg-tsls-cream-100/70 border border-tsls-olive-950/10">
              <strong class="text-tsls-olive-950 block mb-0.5">Sosio-Emosional & Kemandirian</strong>
              <p class="leading-relaxed">Mempraktikkan adab makan, merapikan mainan sendiri (*self-care*), dan berdialog hangat bersama keluarga.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-tsls-olive-950/10 text-[11px] font-semibold text-tsls-olive-800">
        Didukung panduan modul mingguan dari guru TSLS
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>
